    }
  },
  "handNote": {
    "lettering": "The letters were painted with a fine brush, with a maximum stroke width of approximately 2-3 mm. Tau has an oblique upper stroke; alpha has a crossbar descending to the left and a short tail beyond the right stroke; iota is slightly curved to the left.",
